{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 7017, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5493, "text": "- Hey, guys.\nHey, Bull."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 9891, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 7195, "text": "Look what Tanya gave me\nfor Valentine's Day."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 12894, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10699, "text": "Drill bits."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 16003, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 13068, "text": "And they say romance is dead."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 18104, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16671, "text": "What did you get, Dan?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 21265, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18273, "text": "Valentine's Day is a crass\nand exploitive display..."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 23968, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21443, "text": "...by a cynical and narcissistic culture."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 26204, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 24145, "text": "Nothing, huh?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 29573, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27048, "text": "Women who interest me\nwouldn't write valentines."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 32481, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29751, "text": "Even if they knew how."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 36220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32921, "text": "Fact is, I'm flat broke\nand women are ignoring me, okay?"}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 39383, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36391, "text": "They've come to expect that\na romantic evening might mean..."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 41722, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39561, "text": "...anything from Peking duck\nand champagne to..."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 44694, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41896, "text": "Sodium pentothal."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 47291, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45300, "text": "It was a root canal.\nShe needed a lift home."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 49266, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47469, "text": "One thing led to..."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 51598, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49437, "text": "You were guessing, weren't you?"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 56238, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52507, "text": "- Selma, happy Valentine's Day.\nAww."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 59839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56711, "text": "Harry, it's beautiful."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 62074, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60015, "text": "- What do I owe you?\nOh."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 64315, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62484, "text": "Selma."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 66347, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64652, "text": "A dollar."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 70457, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67989, "text": "- What's that, sir?\n- Got this for Billie."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 73321, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70625, "text": "This just happens to be\nthe hot Valentine's Day item:"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 74928, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73495, "text": "Cookie on a stick."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 77963, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75096, "text": "You have no idea how much trouble\nI went through to get this."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 79430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78133, "text": "- Hi, guys.\n- Hi."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 80966, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79601, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 83331, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 81136, "text": "Look what David got me."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 87932, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85907, "text": "Imagine that."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 91807, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89077, "text": "Looks like this David thing's\ngetting serious."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 93475, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92213, "text": "Who knows?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 98081, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95817, "text": "What does he do?"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 102111, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98653, "text": "Everything I like."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 106517, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103491, "text": "You don't have to draw me any pictures."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 109219, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 106694, "text": "Unless, of course, you want to."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 112923, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 109931, "text": "Billie, I believe the question was\nwhat does he do for a living?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 117697, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113101, "text": "Oh. Oh. Well, he's in public relations.\nBefore that, he sailed solo around the world."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 119999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117872, "text": "Before that,\nhe was full professor at Harvard."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 123269, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 120175, "text": "And before that,\nhe was a test pilot in the Navy."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 125709, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 123445, "text": "Can't hold a job."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 131081, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 127782, "text": "- Guess who.\nDavid."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 134045, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 131986, "text": "How about dinner tonight\nwhen you're through?"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 136554, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 134222, "text": "Thought you had a reception\nat city hall tonight."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 140023, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136724, "text": "Oh, I'll duck out early.\nEd will understand."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 142087, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 140495, "text": "Excuse us."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 147896, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145200, "text": "What's he got that I haven't got?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 152938, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 148069, "text": "Do you want it alphabetically\nor in order of importance?"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 157769, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154709, "text": "Aww. Champagne.\nYou are so sweet, but I can't."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 159345, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 157946, "text": "I have to go back to work."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 162039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 159514, "text": "I know.\nThat's why it's sparkling apple cider."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 165109, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163585, "text": "You think of everything."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 169148, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166020, "text": "I am thinking of everything right now."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 191770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188710, "text": "Low degree of difficulty\ncost you a couple of tenths."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 248496, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 247268, "text": "The usual."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 252071, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248670, "text": "Selma, can I ask you\na personal question?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 254606, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252240, "text": "- No.\n- God, I love your wit."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 259442, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256211, "text": "Selma, do you have any idea how I feel?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 263812, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259614, "text": "My pulse is racing, my flesh is tingling,\nmy palms are sweating."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 268086, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264719, "text": "Sounds like subdural hematoma."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 269917, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268256, "text": "It's you, Selma."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 272992, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270091, "text": "I have to know once and for all\nwhere I stand."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 277325, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273161, "text": "There's a limit even\nto my understanding and patience."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 283097, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279934, "text": "- For example...\n- Go away, Bernie."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 286900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 283271, "text": "I'm sorry, Selma,\nbut I have to give you an ultimatum."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 289407, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287075, "text": "I need the answer to a simple question."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 291442, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289577, "text": "Do we have a future together?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 295441, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292313, "text": "Don't answer. Take till midnight."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 299553, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295617, "text": "If at midnight the answer is still no, fine."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 303088, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299721, "text": "I'll sell the stand, I'll leave forever..."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 305351, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 303258, "text": "...a broken and pathetic man."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 308261, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306361, "text": "But before I do..."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 315525, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 314035, "text": "Here."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 319233, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317038, "text": "Happy Valentine's Day."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 320698, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319674, "text": "What is it?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 323275, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320875, "text": "It's a videotape machine."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 331518, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324646, "text": "Mm-hm. Wireless remote, fast-forward scan,\nslo-mo, six-month warranty."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 334854, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331953, "text": "This is not romantic, Bernie."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 337685, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335023, "text": "It is if we watch this."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 343825, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340128, "text": "\"Retirement Home of Lust\"?"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 349302, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345400, "text": "I hear the bocce-ball scene is wild."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 358535, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355043, "text": "Excuse me.\nI got a message for a Billie Young."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 360840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358713, "text": "First desk on the left."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 374453, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370858, "text": "This is temporary. I'm really a novelist."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 380964, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379167, "text": "Billie Young?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 384663, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383571, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 386898, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384839, "text": "This is from David."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 393175, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390411, "text": "<i>Oh, you beautiful doll</i>"}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 395942, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393348, "text": "<i>You great, big beautiful doll</i>"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 399943, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396451, "text": "<i>If you ever leave me\nHow my heart would ache</i>"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 403522, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400121, "text": "<i>I wanna hug you but I fear you'll break</i>"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 406319, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403691, "text": "<i>Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!</i>"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 410627, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406861, "text": "<i>Oh, you beautiful doll</i>"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 420535, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417338, "text": "Never seen anything like that\nbefore in my life."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 424075, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420708, "text": "God did, the day before the flood."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 426374, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424679, "text": "Wasn't that cute?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 428538, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426547, "text": "The singing heart? Oh, yeah, darling."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 432345, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428716, "text": "Nothing like a little aortal caroling\nto get the old toes tapping, huh?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 434613, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 432520, "text": "- Slug.\n- Cardiovascular freak."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 438384, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434789, "text": "<i>Next case, Your Honor.\nPeople v. Mr. And Mrs. Shelton.</i>"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 441858, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438559, "text": "- Take it easy with the suit, young fellow.\n- Doesn't fit you, anyway."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 443087, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442029, "text": "Shut up."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 444856, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443264, "text": "I will not. You make me."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 446525, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 445433, "text": "Here you go, sir."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 448566, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446701, "text": "They tried to escape twice."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 450601, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448736, "text": "We're feisty."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 453404, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451038, "text": "I can see that. Mr. Prosecutor?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 457442, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453574, "text": "Yes, sir. The defendants were arrested\nfor disturbing the peace at a local eatery..."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 461013, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457612, "text": "...after they turned over the salad bar\nand assaulted each other..."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 465278, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461182, "text": "...with baby tomatoes,\nthe three-bean salad and lettuce tongs."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 468320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465453, "text": "The Sheltons' children threw them\na 65th anniversary party..."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 470013, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468489, "text": "...and things got out of hand."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 472819, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470191, "text": "I didn't know she was gonna be there."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 474918, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473428, "text": "Sixty-fifth anniversary?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 476825, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475096, "text": "That's lead."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 480764, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476998, "text": "If I had a gun,\nI'd give Mr. Shelton a little present."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 486533, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483905, "text": "Pardon the presumption,\nbut I'm getting the impression..."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 489039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486707, "text": "...that you lived through\n65 years of marital..."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 490871, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489210, "text": "Agony."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 493405, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491312, "text": "Thanks. Why?"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 496948, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493581, "text": "We were waiting for the children to die."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 505948, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501989, "text": "- Not that we wanted them to die, of course.\n- Of course."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 508391, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506127, "text": "It's just that divorce can be so damaging."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 510895, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508563, "text": "We were only thinking of the boys."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 515331, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511065, "text": "- The boys?\n- Little Freddie will be 64 in April."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 518535, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516237, "text": "And the baby just retired."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 522139, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519841, "text": "This would kill him."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 525105, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522910, "text": "I have no reason to doubt that."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 529413, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528082, "text": "Thirty days."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 530915, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529584, "text": "And, Mr. Bernstein..."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 535215, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531085, "text": "...the next time you deliver valentines,\nwear pants."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 538716, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537658, "text": "What's next, Mac?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 541259, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538893, "text": "<i>People v. Towers, Your Honor.</i>"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 544557, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541429, "text": "Towers, that's funny.\nYou know, that's the last name of my..."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 546427, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544732, "text": "David?"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 548859, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547335, "text": "The defendant, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 550060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549036, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 556867, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551372, "text": "All right, this is a joke. That's funny.\nYou guys are all in on this, right? Ha-ha-ha."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 563006, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560481, "text": "The charge is grand larceny."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 564674, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563184, "text": "Pickpocketing."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 568278, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 565753, "text": "Listen, I may be a little late tonight."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 578489, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 575463, "text": "He's got a dozen priors. Two convictions."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 582102, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578666, "text": "Well, this is just a mix-up\nand I'm sure there's a rational explanation."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 583464, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582270, "text": "Go ahead, tell him, David."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 586740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584272, "text": "Tell Judge Stone\nthat there's a simple explanation."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 588967, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586908, "text": "- There's a simple explanation.\n- See?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 590838, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 589143, "text": "I'm a criminal."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 594439, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592380, "text": "That would explain it."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 597443, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595816, "text": "You're a criminal."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 599147, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597919, "text": "You lied to me."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 602050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599320, "text": "We do that. I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 606422, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603658, "text": "You see? He said he's sorry."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 613090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609063, "text": "Miss Young, I'm afraid I have no choice\nbut to disqualify you from this case."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 617504, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615036, "text": "- Miss Young?\n- This isn't happening."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 619967, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618739, "text": "I'm dreaming."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 622267, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620174, "text": "That's it. This is a dream."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 623774, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 622443, "text": "Billie."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 626778, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623945, "text": "It's not a particularly pleasant dream."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 630315, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626948, "text": "- Say, Billie, why don't you...?\n- You stay away from me or I'll jump."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 636618, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633387, "text": "I think she's bluffing."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 641885, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637858, "text": "I mean, a guy appears to make\na little mistake, you know? Heh-heh."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 645658, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642063, "text": "And all of a sudden,\nit's like everybody gets all excited..."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 647994, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645833, "text": "...like they think\nhe's Al Capone or something."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 650433, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648169, "text": "Well, look what he did\non Valentine's Day."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 655809, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 652373, "text": "But what am I talking about?\nThis is a dream."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 660539, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656978, "text": "And I can wake up anytime I want."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 670056, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 667588, "text": "At least she's taking it well."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 675351, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673861, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 681766, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678399, "text": "They can't seem to find her\nanywhere in the building."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 683394, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682336, "text": "Poor thing."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 687268, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683571, "text": "She's probably wandering aimlessly\nthrough the streets..."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 692640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 687441, "text": "...the cruel wind whipping mercilessly\nacross her chafed little face..."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 695441, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692813, "text": "...dogs nipping at her heels."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 697208, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695616, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 700446, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699286, "text": "Or not."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 702213, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700621, "text": "Stunning imagery, though, sir."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 705991, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703591, "text": "Oh, well, uh, excuse me. Uh..."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 708924, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706160, "text": "I've got some labels to lick."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 712098, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710631, "text": "I heard you were looking for me."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 713290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712266, "text": "Yeah. How you doing?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 717130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713467, "text": "You want some coffee or tea or something?\nI think we've got a box of croutons."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 719397, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717304, "text": "Harry, I'm fine, thanks."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 722698, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721208, "text": "You sure seem chipper."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 726741, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723544, "text": "I took a long brisk walk,\ndid some thinking..."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 730145, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726914, "text": "...ripped all the wallpaper\noff my apartment."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 732609, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730584, "text": "- Feel better?\n- Yeah."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 735255, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732787, "text": "I was planning on redecorating, anyway."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 740486, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737892, "text": "Guess I kind of freaked out\nfor a couple of hours."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 743289, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740661, "text": "That's natural, Billie.\nYou had a tremendous shock."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 745398, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 743464, "text": "Don't get much bigger, that's for sure."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 747227, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745566, "text": "What are you gonna do now?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 753367, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749203, "text": "You don't stop loving a person\nbecause they have a bad habit."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 758571, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756410, "text": "Bad habit?"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 762113, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758746, "text": "Billie, we're not talking\nabout somebody who picks his toes."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 766242, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762283, "text": "This guy is a habitual criminal."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 768718, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 766420, "text": "Well, maybe he just can't help himself."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 771016, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768889, "text": "That's what habitual means."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 774059, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771659, "text": "I love him, Harry,\nand I'm not gonna just walk away."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 777295, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774895, "text": "We had some great times together."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 782665, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779400, "text": "- So did we.\n- Beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 787867, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783771, "text": "Hey, you remember that time when we were\ntied together at gunpoint on my birthday?"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 789168, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788042, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 791670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790544, "text": "No?"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 794906, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791846, "text": "- Bail reports, Your Honor.\n- How do you forget something like that?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 799678, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795082, "text": "We were bound hand and foot,\nour bodies tightly pressed together."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 802948, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799854, "text": "<i>Uh, Sidney Sheldon,\nThe Other Side of Midnight.</i>"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 805615, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 803124, "text": "- What is it, Bull?\n- Bail reports."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 808921, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 805793, "text": "- Eat them.\n- Okay."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 816063, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812900, "text": "I'm sorry, Harry.\nMy mind's on other things."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 818501, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816237, "text": "I'm gonna go down\nto the holding cell, okay?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 820264, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 819240, "text": "Billie..."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 827547, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824578, "text": "- Be careful.\n- I'll try."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 829841, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828249, "text": "Thanks for caring."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 834113, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830017, "text": "I used a pair of extra-large handcuffs\non him. Less chafing."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 837655, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834288, "text": "- Thank you too.\nMm."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 845923, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842897, "text": "<i>\"The Other Side of Midnight\"?</i>"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 849630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847935, "text": "<i>Gorky Park?</i>"}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 876619, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 875095, "text": "Come here often?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 880797, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876997, "text": "Heh. Not as a rule. Bad for business."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 883596, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880968, "text": "Tell me you can change\nand we'll forget your business."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 886296, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883771, "text": "- I can't change.\n- That's not what I told you to say."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 888236, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886473, "text": "- Hey, calm down.\n- Calm down?"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 890969, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888409, "text": "I find out that the man of my dreams\nis Butch Cassidy..."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 892669, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891145, "text": "...and you tell me to calm down?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 894314, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892847, "text": "Butch Cassidy, now that's funny."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 897006, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894481, "text": "Stop being funny and charming."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 898976, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 897418, "text": "- Billie, look at me.\n- Nope."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 901212, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899153, "text": "You have bars all over your face."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 903322, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901388, "text": "Billie."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 906753, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905593, "text": "What?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 909754, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908696, "text": "It's over."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 911493, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910231, "text": "What's over?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 913889, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912399, "text": "Us."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 916263, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914068, "text": "We had some laughs,\nlet's just leave it at that."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 919764, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916670, "text": "Laughs? Ha, ha, ha, ha."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 922738, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919940, "text": "Laughs, huh? Did you hear this?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 926505, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922910, "text": "Biff the Wonder Stud here just informed me\nthat our whole relationship..."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 929979, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926680, "text": "...consists of nothing more than\ngiving each other a few good chuckles."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 931447, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930150, "text": "That's not what I meant."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 932643, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931619, "text": "Okay, I forgive you."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 936119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 932820, "text": "What we've gotta do is to find you\nsome really good psychiatric help."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 938155, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 936290, "text": "Look, it is just not going to work out."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 941954, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 938325, "text": "- Give me one good reason why not.\n- I'm a criminal, you're a lawyer."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 946691, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942129, "text": "So? Two-career couples\nare very fashionable these days."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 952932, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948302, "text": "- You don't understand. I want out.\nYeah, I want out too."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 955332, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954308, "text": "No, no, no."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 957477, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955509, "text": "- I mean out of the relationship.\nAww."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 961041, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958846, "text": "You want out of the relationship?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 964779, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962049, "text": "Oh, you."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 968854, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 964952, "text": "Oh, you had me going for a minute there.\nI almost thought you were serious."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 970752, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969023, "text": "I am serious."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 973391, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972026, "text": "You said you loved me."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 976829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974361, "text": "If I loved you,\nI'd change for you, wouldn't I?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 982426, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 980401, "text": "Yeah, I guess you would."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 984665, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983437, "text": "No hard feelings?"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 986931, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984838, "text": "No, no hard feelings."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 991135, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988575, "text": "- But, David...\n- Goodbye."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 996479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994682, "text": "You stole my heart, kid."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1001282, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998085, "text": "Yeah, that's what criminals do."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1017000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013667, "text": "Don't ask. This isn't my day."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1022040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017171, "text": "I get into a fight for a cab on Broadway\nand they throw the book at me."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1023904, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022209, "text": "Look."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1026410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024078, "text": "My heart is broken."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1032446, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029750, "text": "You couldn't resist, could you?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1040451, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037391, "text": "It's not what you think, fellows."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1045492, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1042796, "text": "So how about dinner, Stephanie, huh?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1048362, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045666, "text": "Uh-huh.\nYou ever been to the Russian Tea Room?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1053632, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048535, "text": "That's the one, Old World charm,\ncelebrities, fabulous food."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1057106, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053807, "text": "Okay, there's a Wimpy's\nabout a block over... Uh..."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1060371, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057277, "text": "Hello? Hello?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1070684, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069023, "text": "Yo, Towers."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1071882, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070858, "text": "Hi, judge."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1074550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072059, "text": "I don't know what you said to her\nor what you did..."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1076525, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074728, "text": "...but you hurt her real bad."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1078562, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076697, "text": "She's out there crying her eyes out."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1081093, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078966, "text": "It's over between us."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1082292, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081268, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1085103, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083670, "text": "Good."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1092140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1089376, "text": "She dumped you, didn't she?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1100282, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096016, "text": "No, as a matter of fact, she offered\nto stay with me through thick and thin."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1102618, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100821, "text": "She's quite a woman."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1104855, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103490, "text": "Tell me about it."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1111186, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107694, "text": "You mean you dumped her?"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1113627, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112433, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1117101, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1114268, "text": "Mister, if I weren't a judge\nand you weren't behind bars..."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1119705, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117271, "text": "...I would ask you\nto step outside right now!"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1123274, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120874, "text": "Well, I'd mop up the street with you, sir."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1127273, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125612, "text": "So you would."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1131083, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128148, "text": "What's the difference?\nState has got a great case against me."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1135312, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131251, "text": "With my record, they'll give me\nthree, maybe four years, and..."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1138556, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137157, "text": "And what?"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1140458, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139059, "text": "Nothing."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1147096, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145265, "text": "You did this for her, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1149067, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147668, "text": "I don't wanna talk anymore."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1152333, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151071, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1154704, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152873, "text": "That makes sense."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1156900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155342, "text": "You fall in love with her..."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1160103, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157077, "text": "...she finds out about you\nbefore you can change..."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1161440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160280, "text": "...so you dump her."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1165244, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161615, "text": "Spare her the agony of waiting for you\nwhile you're in jail."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1168744, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166753, "text": "You sneaky little..."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1174288, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171558, "text": "You're a great guy, aren't you?"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1178787, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176296, "text": "I don't have to take this abuse."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1183693, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180667, "text": "Towers, that's noble."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1188205, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183871, "text": "But I'm afraid I don't buy into that\nyou-gotta-be-cruel-to-be-kind philosophy."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1190400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1188375, "text": "It's a coward's way out."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1191874, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190577, "text": "You talk to her."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1194309, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192045, "text": "You tell her how you feel."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1197006, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194481, "text": "It'll spare her some of the hurt\nshe's going through..."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1200711, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197184, "text": "...thinking that you don't love her."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1205584, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203457, "text": "Well, maybe you're right..."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1206783, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205759, "text": "...but I won't do it."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1208052, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206960, "text": "- Then I'll tell her.\n- I'll lie."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1209559, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208228, "text": "- She'll believe me.\n- Are you sure?"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1213297, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211932, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1220133, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216436, "text": "You love her too, don't you?"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1223332, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221341, "text": "That's ridiculous."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1225375, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223510, "text": "We haven't even..."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1229113, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1226713, "text": "...drunk out of the same cup."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1232315, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230984, "text": "Your Honor."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1241759, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238358, "text": "If by any chance she's still available\nwhen I get out..."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1243328, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241929, "text": "...l'm coming back after her."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1245863, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244464, "text": "Sounds like a threat."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1248257, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246733, "text": "Just giving you fair warning."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1251529, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1248435, "text": "You've got exactly four years..."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1253434, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251705, "text": "...from right now."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1259036, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255976, "text": "By the way, I cheat."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1269787, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267387, "text": "Your ventricle's showing."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1275859, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274528, "text": "This is the greatest."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1277326, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276029, "text": "- Heh.\n- I can't wait to get home..."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1280125, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277497, "text": "- Oh, hey, guys.\n- Hey."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1282666, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280300, "text": "Steak dinners on me, huh?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1284531, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282836, "text": "Oh, sounds great, Dan."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1287037, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284705, "text": "What's with the sudden benevolence?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1291405, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289676, "text": "Bingo."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1294445, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291578, "text": "From a secret admirer. Hmm?"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1297076, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295916, "text": "Scented too."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1298479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297251, "text": "Hey, that's great, Dan."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1301849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298652, "text": "- Hold on a second, I'll get my coat.\n- Yeah."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1306654, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303924, "text": "I guess he didn't recognize\nmy handwriting."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1311396, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1308962, "text": "Or my aftershave lotion."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1313490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312432, "text": "So, huh? You know what?"}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1316659, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313667, "text": "I think it's that blond on the ninth floor.\nThe one with the giant, uh..."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1332548, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1329249, "text": "- Well?\n- The answer is no, Bernie."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1335112, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333520, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1338258, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1335289, "text": "I'll give you six more months,\nbut that's it."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1346123, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1344064, "text": "Go ahead, say I told you so."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1347392, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346300, "text": "About what?"}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1349529, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347834, "text": "You were right about David."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1351360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349870, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1353568, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351805, "text": "I'm not so sure anymore."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1355966, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354408, "text": "What's that supposed to mean?"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1361308, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356143, "text": "Well, let's just say that I think\nI understand what you saw in him."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1365417, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362482, "text": "- Gonna be a hard one to get over, Harry.\n- Yeah."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1368552, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1366687, "text": "Maybe this will help."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1371247, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369723, "text": "A stick."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1377422, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375295, "text": "Happy Valentine's, Billie."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1379895, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1377597, "text": "Oh, Harry, you're wonderful."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1383468, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1381568, "text": "There's a question\nI've been dying to ask."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1385935, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1383637, "text": "- What's that?\n- Why you wearing two watches?"}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1390707, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1388842, "text": "I cheat too."}
